    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classQfUdpReceiver" kindref="compound">QfUdpReceiver</ref> connects to a device and feeds the QgsNmeaConnection over a UDP socket. It receives QgsGpsInformation and converts it to <ref refid="classQfGnssPositionInformation" kindref="compound">QfGnssPositionInformation</ref> </para>
